# ── local-only / private — NEVER commit ──────────────────────────────
# Planning drafts, distribution material, private benchmarks, infra/machine
# notes, analytics exports all live under thoughts/. Committed here (not just
# in .git/info/exclude) so protection travels to every clone.
thoughts/
.env
.env.*
*.local
# project instructions doc — not committed until sanitized + explicitly approved
CLAUDE.md

# ── site build outputs & caches (generated, never committed) ─────────
# site/src/content/generated/ is produced by sync-content at build time.
site/node_modules/
site/dist/
site/.astro/
site/src/content/generated/

# ── tooling caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
